	<p><font face="verdana, arial, helvetica" size="2" class="nf">Has anyone tried using the Filemon utility from the <a href="http://www.sysinternals.net" target="_blank">sysinternals</a> web site? It provides the ability to monitor file system activity in real time.<br />
